{"unit":13,"section":1,"cefr":"Intro","objective":"use object pronouns","skill":"Direct Object","heading":"Use object pronouns","phrases":[{"he":"אני לא צריך אותם, יש לי אותךָ!","en":"I do not need them, I have you!","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/0507a435326c92b0560465ce2df55733","tokens":[{"w":"אני","h":["I","I am","me"]},{"w":"לא","h":["do not","not","is not"]},{"w":"צריך","h":["need","have to","needs"]},{"w":"אותם","h":["them","the same"]},{"w":"יש","h":["I have","have","there are","has"]},{"w":"לי","h":["I have","me","to me","for me"]},{"w":"אותךָ","h":["you"]}]},{"he":"אני אוהב אותךְ.","en":"I love you.","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/7a0d04d9196221a4138f62926d830bc2","tokens":[{"w":"אני","h":["I","I am","me"]},{"w":"אוהב","h":["love","like","likes"]},{"w":"אותךְ","h":["you"]}]},{"he":"אנחנו רואות אותו.","en":"We see him.","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/41789af304e4583c17df534f5273e047","tokens":[{"w":"אנחנו","h":["we","we are"]},{"w":"רואות","h":["see"]},{"w":"אותו","h":["him","it","the same"]}]},{"he":"אני רוצֶה אותן, הן שלי.","en":"I want them, they are mine.","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/0448cd337285be13a0b8b845503caf93","tokens":[{"w":"אני","h":["I","I am","me"]},{"w":"רוצֶה","h":["want","wants","would like"]},{"w":"אותן","h":["them","the same"]},{"w":"הן","h":["they are","they","are"]},{"w":"שלי","h":["mine","my"]}]}],"sentences":[{"he":"הם רוצים אתכן.","en":"They want you.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הן רואות אותה.","en":"They see her.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"זה כולל אותךָ!","en":"That includes you!","alt":[],"t":"l","inferred":1},{"he":"אני אוהב אותךְ.","en":"I love you.","alt":[],"t":"t","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/7a0d04d9196221a4138f62926d830bc2"},{"he":"אני צריך אותךְ.","en":"I need you.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אני רוצֶה אותו.","en":"I want him.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אתה צריך אותנו?","en":"Do you need us?","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אתה רואֶה אותי?","en":"Do you see me?","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"היא אוהבת אותי!","en":"She loves me!","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הם רואים אותךְ.","en":"They see you.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הם שולחים אותו.","en":"They are sending him.","alt":[],"t":"l","inferred":1},{"he":"אני אוהבת אותךָ.","en":"I love you.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"אני אוהבת אותךְ.","en":"I love you.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"אנחנו רואות אותו.","en":"We see him.","alt":[],"t":"t","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/41789af304e4583c17df534f5273e047"},{"he":"אנחנו רואות אתכן.","en":"We see you.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"אני לא אוהב אותה.","en":"I don't love her.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"אני צריך את הספר.","en":"I need the book.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"אתם רואים את הדג?","en":"Do you see the fish?","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הארנב רואֶה אתכם.","en":"The rabbit sees you.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אני לא צריכה אותו.","en":"I do not need him.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אני לא רואֶה אותם.","en":"I do not see them.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"החיות אוהבות אתכם.","en":"The animals love you.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"החתולה רואָה אותי.","en":"The cat sees me.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"היא לא אוהבת אותו.","en":"She does not love him.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"את לא צריכה לברוח.","en":"You do not need to run away.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"הוא לא רואֶה אותךָ.","en":"He does not see you.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הסוס שלה אוהב אותה.","en":"Her horse loves her.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"היא לא רואָה אותנו.","en":"She does not see us.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"הם לא עוזבים אותךָ!","en":"They are not leaving you!","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"הכלב שלי זוכר אותךָ.","en":"My dog remembers you.","alt":[],"t":"l","inferred":1},{"he":"אני צריך כרית ושמיכה.","en":"I need a pillow and a blanket.","alt":[],"t":"l","inferred":1},{"he":"אני רוצֶה אותן, הן שלי.","en":"I want them, they are mine.","alt":[],"t":"t","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/0448cd337285be13a0b8b845503caf93"},{"he":"החתול שלי לא אוהב אותן.","en":"My cat does not like them.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הכלב שלי לא אוהב אותךָ.","en":"My dog does not like you.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הם רוצים אותנו או אותם?","en":"Do they want us or them?","alt":[],"t":"l","inferred":1},{"he":"נשים, אנחנו צריכים אתכן.","en":"Women, we need you.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"העוגה צריכה להכיל שוקולד.","en":"The cake must contain chocolate.","alt":[],"t":"l","inferred":1},{"he":"בעידן שלנו לא צריכים את זה.","en":"In our age you do not need it.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"אני לא צריך אותם, יש לי אותךָ!","en":"I do not need them, I have you!","alt":[],"t":"t","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/0507a435326c92b0560465ce2df55733"},{"he":"הברווז שלי לא רוצֶה לאכול אתכם.","en":"My duck does not want to eat you.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הביצים טעימות, אני רוצֶה לאכול אותן.","en":"The eggs are tasty, I want to eat them.","alt":[],"t":"t"}],"hints":{"הם":"are / they / they are","רוצים":"do you want / want / want (m.p - pres.)","אתכן":"you (f.p)","הן":"are / they / they are","רואות":"see / see (f.p - pres.)","אותה":"her","זה":"it / it is / it's","כולל":"m.s.","אותךָ":"you / thee, you (m.s) / thee, you (f.s)","אני":"I / I am / I am a girl","אוהב":"like / likes / love","אותךְ":"you / thee, you (m.s) / thee, you (f.s)","צריך":"has to / have to / need","רוצֶה":"want / wants / would like","אותו":"him / it / the same","אתה":"you / you are / you (m.s)","אותנו":"us","רואֶה":"is seeing / see / sees","אותי":"me","היא":"her / it / she","אוהבת":"like / likes / love","רואים":"see (m.p - pres.)","שולחים":"m.p.","אנחנו":"we / we are / we (c.p)","לא":"aren't / didn't / do not","את":"it / that / the fruit","הספר":"the book","אתם":"do you want / you / you are","אתכם":"you / you (m.p)","צריכה":"need / needs / should","אותם":"the same / them / them (m)","החיות":"at the zoo / in the zoo / the animals","אוהבות":"love(s) (f.p - pres.)","רואָה":"is seeing / see / sees","לברוח":"escape, run away / to run away, escape","הוא":"(he) is / (it) is / he","הסוס":"the horse / the horse is","שלה":"her / her boys / her children","עוזבים":"m.p.","הכלב":"the dog","שלי":"mine / my","זוכר":"m.s.","כרית":"pillow","אותן":"the same / them / them (f)","החתול":"the cat","או":"or","נשים":"woman / wife / women","צריכים":"need / one needs / we should have","להכיל":"to contain, include, comprise","שוקולד":"chocolate","שלנו":"our / ours","יש":"I have / do you have / has","לי":"I have / for me / me","לאכול":"eat / eating / to eat","טעימות":"tasty (f.p)"},"words":[{"he":"שלי","en":"mine","alt":["my"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"sheli"},{"he":"צריך","en":"need","alt":["has to","have to","needs"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"tzarikh"},{"he":"אותו","en":"him","alt":["it","the same"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"oto"},{"he":"אותם","en":"them","alt":["the same"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"otam"},{"he":"אותךָ","en":"you","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"ot'kha"},{"he":"רואות","en":"see","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"ro'ot"},{"he":"אותן","en":"the same","alt":["them"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"otan"},{"he":"אותנו","en":"Us","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"otanu"},{"he":"אתכן","en":"You (f.p)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"et'khen"},{"he":"אותה","en":"Her","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"otah"},{"he":"אותי","en":"Me","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"oti"},{"he":"אתכם","en":"you","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"et'khem"},{"he":"צריכים","en":"one needs","alt":["need","we should have"],"from":"skill"},{"he":"צריכה","en":"needs","alt":["need","should"],"from":"skill"},{"he":"רואים","en":"See (m.p - pres.)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"ro'im"},{"he":"אני","en":"I","alt":["I am","me"],"from":"phrase","tr":"ani"},{"he":"לא","en":"not","alt":["do not","is not"],"from":"phrase","tr":"lo"},{"he":"יש","en":"have","alt":["I have","there are","has"],"from":"phrase","tr":"yesh"},{"he":"לי","en":"I have","alt":["me","to me","for me"],"from":"phrase","tr":"li"},{"he":"אוהב","en":"love","alt":["like","likes"],"from":"phrase","tr":"ohev"},{"he":"אנחנו","en":"we","alt":["we are"],"from":"phrase","tr":"anakhnu"},{"he":"רוצֶה","en":"want","alt":["wants","would like"],"from":"phrase","tr":"rotzeh"},{"he":"הן","en":"are","alt":["they are","they"],"from":"phrase","tr":"hen"}],"lexemes":["אותו","אותם","אותנו","אתכן","אותן","אותךָ","אותךְ","אותה","אותי","אתכם","צריכים","צריכה","רואים","צריך","רואות"],"tips":"We have already met the direct object connector: \"אֵת\"(et).\n\nIt is considered a preposition and we use it to mark a direct object (the receiver of an action). It appears when there is a definite article attached to the noun (i.e. \"the\" - \"ה\").\n\nIn some cases the word \"ה\" is not necessary to express a specific direct object, for example, nouns related to family members (mom, dad, sister, brother etc.), and people's names. That's because family members are usually specified (people usually have one mother and one father).\n\nFor example:\n \n \"אני אוהב **את** אמא שלי\" - I love my mom.\n\"אני אוהב **את** טל\" - I love Tal.\n\n----------------------\nThe suffixes of the word \"את\"\n----------------------\n\nThe word \"את\" has suffixes to indicate person and number, like every other preposition. Note that the plural \"you\" bucks the trend and starts with \"et\", not \"ot\":\n\nEnglish | Hebrew\n---|---\nMe | אות**י** (ot**i**)\nYou (singular masculine) | אות**ךָ** (ot**kha**)\nYou (singular feminine) |אות**ךְ** (ot**akh**)\nHim | אות**ו** (ot**o**)\nHer | אות**ה** (ot**a**)\nUs | אות**נו** (ot**anu**)\nYou (plural masculine) | את**כם** (et**khem**)\nYou (plural feminine) | את**כן** (et**khen**)\nThem (masculine) | אות**ם** (ot**am**)\nThem (feminine) | אות**ן** (ot**an**)\n\nYou might hear some native Israeli speakers using אותכם/אותכן (otkhem/otkhen) for the 2nd person plural, \"you\". This follows the pattern of \"ot\" used by the other persons of the word, but it is technically incorrect."}